   --  and a torsion pair, each costing a unit of normal force; gravity is the
   --  right-hand side. The touches cannot hold it, so the program is
   --  infeasible, and it is degenerate at every vertex: the rows with nothing
   --  on their right-hand side come out of the eliminations as noise of either
